  <Placemark>
      <name>ADA 2</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>monotubolare</h3><h2>ADA 2</h2><img src="https://unmig.mase.gov.it/wp-content/uploads/dati/kml/img/piattaforme/m_ada-2.jpg" border=0><br><br><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; border: 1px solid grey;"><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Anno costruzione</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">1982</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Tipo</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">monotubolare</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Minerale</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">GAS</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Operatore</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">ENI</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Titolo minerario</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">A.C  9.AG</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Zona</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">ZA</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Foglio</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">924/M</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Sezione UNMIG</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">Bologna</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Capitaneria di porto</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">Chioggia</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Longitudine (WGS 84)</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">12,591285</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Latitudine (WGS84)</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">45,183634</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Distanza costa</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">20 Km</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Entro il limite delle 12 miglia dalla linea di costa e dalle aree protette</th><td valign=top>S&igrave;</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Altezza SLM</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">15 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Profondit&agrave; fondale</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">25 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Dimensioni</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">8 x 8 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Numero pozzi allacciati</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">1</td></tr></table><br>Note<br>Piattaforma in attesa di decommissioning - Progetto di rimozione presentato<br><br>Pozzi produttivi non eroganti&nbsp;(1)<br><ol style="margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:15px;"><li>ADA 002</ol>]]></description>
