  <Placemark>
      <name>AGOSTINO A</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>struttura&nbsp;reticolare&nbsp;8&nbsp;gambe</h3><h2>AGOSTINO A</h2><img src="https://unmig.mase.gov.it/wp-content/uploads/dati/kml/img/piattaforme/m_agostino-a.jpg" border=0><br><br><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; border: 1px solid grey;"><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Anno costruzione</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">1970</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Tipo</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">struttura reticolare 8 gambe</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Minerale</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">GAS</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Operatore</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">ENI</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Titolo minerario</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">A.C  1.AG</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Collegata alla centrale</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">CASALBORSETTI</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Zona</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">ZA</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Foglio</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">924/M</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Sezione UNMIG</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">Bologna</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Capitaneria di porto</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">Ravenna</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Longitudine (WGS 84)</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">12,495601</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Latitudine (WGS84)</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">44,540237</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Distanza costa</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">17 Km</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Entro il limite delle 12 miglia dalla linea di costa e dalle aree protette</th><td valign=top>S&igrave;</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Altezza SLM</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">50 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Profondit&agrave; fondale</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">23 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Dimensioni</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">46 x 22 m</td></tr><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Numero pozzi allacciati</th><td style="padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; border: 1px solid grey;">12</td></tr></table><br>Note<br>Collegata alla piattaforma GARIBALDI T - Raccorda alla piattaforma GARIBALDI T anche le piattaforme AGOSTINO A CLUSTER e AGOSTINO B<br><br>Pozzi in produzione&nbsp;(2)<br><ol style="margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:15px;"><li>AGOSTINO 006 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 010 DIR</ol>Pozzi produttivi non eroganti&nbsp;(10)<br><ol style="margin-top:5px; margin-bottom:15px;"><li>AGOSTINO 002<li>AGOSTINO 003 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 004 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 005 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 007 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 008 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 009 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 011 DIR A<li>AGOSTINO 012 DIR<li>AGOSTINO 013 DIR</ol>]]></description>
